{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Calix</strong> is a fast-paced platformer where you die in just one hit, but can also defeat most enemies with a single strike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608620/extras/50bd9d2713721bbcd72ea30fc5483124.avif?t=1755440965\" width=558 height=234 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Viola</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Viola has a fast and deadly combat style, capable of throwing daggers at enemies and marking those who survive to teleport to them and finish them off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608620/extras/e4c2221594c2d6c0284bdd5ed59dd5ba.avif?t=1755440965\" width=558 height=234 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gilda</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gilda has two energy charges that can be used to create an explosion or throw a spear that travels across the entire stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608620/extras/e57fb8c17d862bdf9f775c6660f99159.avif?t=1755440965\" width=558 height=234 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enemies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face a wide variety of enemies, and if you want, activate <strong>Ebrius</strong> mode to make the journey even more challenging, adding new enemies that transcend reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608620/extras/5263e0d982baee5b703728526ece5077.avif?t=1755440965\" width=558 height=234 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Bosses</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of each chapter, face a unique boss that will test your perseverance. These bosses can also become even more challenging with <strong>Ebrius</strong> mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608620/extras/fd555409276a938aa8aed1dd0a07b04a.avif?t=1755440965\" width=558 height=234 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3608620?t=1755440965","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3608620?t=1755440965","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608620/1ea2ac59fb115a37816d6af53ecbda63d38e22b2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755440965","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608620/1ea2ac59fb115a37816d6af53ecbda63d38e22b2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755440965","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game tackles sensitive topics such as suicide."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Calix</strong> is a fast-paced platformer where you die in just one hit, but can also defeat most enemies with a single strike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608620/extras/50bd9d2713721bbcd72ea30fc5483124.avif?t=1755440965\" width=558 height=234 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Viola</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Viola has a fast and deadly combat style, capable of throwing daggers at enemies and marking those who survive to teleport to them and finish them off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608620/extras/e4c2221594c2d6c0284bdd5ed59dd5ba.avif?t=1755440965\" width=558 height=234 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gilda</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gilda has two energy charges that can be used to create an explosion or throw a spear that travels across the entire stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608620/extras/e57fb8c17d862bdf9f775c6660f99159.avif?t=1755440965\" width=558 height=234 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enemies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face a wide variety of enemies, and if you want, activate <strong>Ebrius</strong> mode to make the journey even more challenging, adding new enemies that transcend reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608620/extras/5263e0d982baee5b703728526ece5077.avif?t=1755440965\" width=558 height=234 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Bosses</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of each chapter, face a unique boss that will test your perseverance. These bosses can also become even more challenging with <strong>Ebrius</strong> mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608620/extras/fd555409276a938aa8aed1dd0a07b04a.avif?t=1755440965\" width=558 height=234 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["UnderLight"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_ass